"{\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"There are no complete award journeys in these search results, so none is ready to recommend as a full itinerary. The most useful next step is to request timed itinerary details for the date-only award leads; meanwhile, the cash result offers a rough route-and-price benchmark, not a like-for-like award comparison.\"},{\"k\":\"l\",\"r\":\"A2@2027-01-01/SFO>BKK/E\",\"n\":\"United economy lead\",\"v\":\"This Jan. 1 SFO–BKK summary reports 9 seats and USD 60,500 points, with USD 28.20 in fees shown. It is a useful first lead to investigate for its higher reported seat count and lower listed fees among these leads, but it is only a date-level summary—not a timed itinerary. The points and fee quote have unknown price scope, and the summary does not establish the full routing or bookability.\"},{\"k\":\"l\",\"r\":\"A3@2027-01-01/SFO>BKK/E\",\"n\":\"Alaska economy lead\",\"v\":\"This Jan. 1 summary reports 8 seats and 42,500 points, with USD 50.90 in fees shown. It is another lead to check if the lower listed points figure matters to you, but points across Alaska and United are not directly comparable; its date-only summary also lacks a timed itinerary, and the quote scope is unknown.\"},{\"k\":\"l\",\"r\":\"A1@2027-01-01/SFO>BKK/E\",\"n\":\"Aeroplan economy lead\",\"v\":\"This Jan. 1 summary reports 2 seats and 65,000 points, plus CAD 116.50 in fees. Check it if Aeroplan is your preferred program, but it has fewer reported seats than the other two leads and a higher displayed fee amount; those quotes have unknown scope, and no timed itinerary is provided.\"},{\"k\":\"b\",\"r\":\"C2@2027-01-01T12:00-08:00/SFO>BKK\",\"n\":\"Cash benchmark\",\"v\":\"The Jan. 1 cash search returned USD 686.00 for an SFO–BKK itinerary arriving Jan. 3, with one stop and a 32-hour-10-minute duration. This is a useful cash baseline, not an all-in award comparison: its price scope is unknown, and the search’s returned traveler count does not establish whether the quote is per person or for the party.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"The award summaries are for one requested traveler, but their reported seat counts do not confirm bookable seats or quote scope. None gives flight times or a complete itinerary. Search coverage was partial, including omitted detail queries for SFO–BKK and partial connection-route results; availability and current prices should be confirmed with providers. Ask for timed, bookable itinerary details and confirm the quoted fees and price scope before comparing awards with cash.\"}]}"
